"""
EVENT POS — single-file Python backend
======================================

Database:
    MongoDB / MongoDB Atlas via MONGO_URI

Required environment variables:
    MONGO_URI      e.g. MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://suyashshukla911_db_user:EventPOS2026Test123@cluster0.opwfchb.mongodb.net/?appName=Cluster0
MONGO_DB=event_pos

    MONGO_DB       e.g. event_pos
    EVENT_NAME     optional
    EVENT_DATE     optional, YYYY-MM-DD

Run locally:
    py -m pip install pymongo
    py app.py

The app intentionally keeps the product/pricing rules on the server.
The browser sends only SKU/kind/flavour/quantity. Prices are calculated
again on the server so the browser cannot accidentally change billing data.

The Excel export starts from the supplied LADDUS workbook template and
preserves its original sheets. Three POS sheets are updated with live
event data:
    POS Sales Log
    POS Inventory
    POS Inventory Movements
"""

